Double Riichi third-party notices
==================================

This distribution includes the Rust and frontend dependencies resolved by
Cargo.lock and frontend/package-lock.json. Those lockfiles are the complete,
exact dependency inputs for the build. Each dependency remains under the
license declared by its package; the corresponding package license and notice
text must be retained when redistributing the source or a rebuilt artifact.
This application does not alter those licenses.

