Generated Starter Packs
----------------------
The project-owned generated portraits, icons, and silent voice files under
character-packs/ are dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal.
Each Pack contains the full CC0 text in LICENSE and CC0-NOTICE.txt names every
covered binary file. The generator source is distributed under the project's
MIT OR Apache-2.0 license. Real Characters, trademarks, tile art, and all
third-party assets are excluded from that dedication.

No runtime CDN, system SQLite database, or OpenSSL dependency is required by
this archive. Windows code signing and Sigstore signatures are not provided
for v1.
